WEBVTT

00:18:28.996 --> 00:18:30.996
for every Frankie and every Ines out there,

00:18:30.996 --> 00:18:33.996
but you can at least use your vote

00:18:33.996 --> 00:18:36.996
to stop politicians doing stupid things

00:18:36.996 --> 00:18:38.996
that spread HIV.

00:18:38.996 --> 00:18:40.996
Thank you.

00:18:40.996 --> 00:18:49.996
(Applause)